<title>USA: Coastal Corp Q4 oper shr $2.71 vs $1.01. [CORRECTED 22:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Coastal Corp Q4 oper shr $2.71 vs $1.01. [CORRECTED 22:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.71		    $1.01</p>
<p> Net			    207			111</p>
<p> Revs			 3,343		    2,673</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 106.7		    105.7</p>
<p>Year</p>
<p> Shr primary		$4.54		    $2.40</p>
<p> Net			    403			270</p>
<p> Revs			12,167		   10,457</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 106.3		    105.4</p>
<p>(All data above in millions, except per-share data)</p>
<p>1996 periods include a pretax gain of $272.3 million from the sale of the Utah coal operations. The related income taxes of $95.3 million are included in taxes on income, resulting in an after-tax gain of $177.0 million. Earnings per share impact of the sale was $1.66.</p>
<p>Loss on early extinguishment of debt -- $12.0 million, or 11 cents per share -- (2nd quarter) Discontinuation of regulatory accounting -- $85.6 million or 81 cents (corrects figure) per share - (4th quarter)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
